<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BECKSHAM STARTS FUND RAISING FOR MINVEST.</title>
<headline>BECKSHAM STARTS FUND RAISING FOR MINVEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Messina Investments Ltd (Minvest) announced on Friday that Barbados-based Becksham Corp had commenced fund raising to finance the purchase of the firm.</p>
<p>Minvest said earlier this month it had signed an agreement with Becksham which intended to offer to buy Minvest's entire share capital for 500 cents a share.</p>
<p>The company advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
